 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $1$st *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $1$st *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $1$st *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} & -3 & 3.5 \\\\ -2 & 2\\sqrt{5} & -2.5 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7}\\cdot 1+(-3)\\cdot 0+3.5\\cdot 0 \\\\ (-2)\\cdot 1+2\\sqrt{5}\\cdot 0+(-2.5)\\cdot 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\cdot 1+4\\cdot 0+5\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186101408 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "be5f5e04-2f01-53f2-8591-c58133cd71f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ \\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099610} {:answer/id #uuid "cea56a00-7b9a-582e-bb36-014f084a08d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099611} {:answer/id #uuid "19e549cb-f70f-5feb-a295-b0871f09f0a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{3} \\\\ -3.2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099612} {:answer/id #uuid "481625fa-4152-5af0-8d28-f2e247bb3b2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099613} {:answer/id #uuid "7c7fffdb-3c6f-5a99-b9d5-1823e4a8b907" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099614}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "481625fa-4152-5af0-8d28-f2e247bb3b2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099613} :answer-field/id #uuid "58019043-5b9b-509d-bec2-1f0d3fe2ba2b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186099609}] :question/id #uuid "05da9b48-a1ff-5fcf-a365-aa02a133b9d8" :question/math-academy-id "q-41950" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A = \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\n\\displaystyle B = \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3} \\\\ -3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$ is the third row of $I_3$. Multiplying $B$ on the left by this row selects the third row of $B$. Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265864 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13fee5aa-433b-519c-a879-d278aa8a48f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263188} {:answer/id #uuid "41aaa268-3659-536e-98cb-3962c98cba4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263581} {:answer/id #uuid "4b7ae9d8-1791-5400-b198-890be82afcf7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263650} {:answer/id #uuid "51369c57-0490-5682-9521-7d30dfd3b175" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263705} {:answer/id #uu