bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$EF=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $E$ is the $4$th *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{4}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $4\\times 4$ matrix $F$ by the $4$th *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{4}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $4$th *row* of $F.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nEF=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 & \\sqrt{19} & -4 & -\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}EF & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & -8 & \\sqrt{5} & 14 \\\\ -2 & \\frac{7}{5} & -\\frac{\\pi }{2} & 9 \\\\ \\sqrt{17} & -6 & 0 & \\frac{e}{3} \\\\ -11 & \\sqrt{19} & -4 & -\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 & \\sqrt{19} & -4 & -\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326916 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "062eed09-81dd-5674-a309-e790c54980b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324028} {:answer/id #uuid "374dbd31-4def-5c1f-8b3b-f510d1346987" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} \\\\ -3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324421} {:answer/id #uuid "55bfa436-004a-568e-80e1-3838e7d226da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324685} {:answer/id #uuid "b96e5865-e78d-55e1-b385-bbe41fc15642" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325561} {:answer/id #uuid "f290c9b6-f341-5