1b1-e507-551a-b225-8b558b92d6a6" :question/math-academy-id "q-337672" :question/problem "Find the product $CD$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle D=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & \\sqrt{2} & 10 & -\\frac{1}{5} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & -7 & \\pi  & 0 \\\\ 6 & -\\sqrt{11} & -\\frac{9}{4} & \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2) \\\\ 12 & -3 & \\sqrt{13} & -e\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$CD=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $C$ is the $3$rd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{4}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $4\\times 4$ matrix $D$ by the $3$rd *row* of the identity matrix ${I}_{4}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $3$rd *row* of $D.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nCD=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -\\sqrt{11} & -\\frac{9}{4} & \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CD & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & \\sqrt{2} & 10 & -\\frac{1}{5} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & -7 & \\pi  & 0 \\\\ 6 & -\\sqrt{11} & -\\frac{9}{4} & \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2) \\\\ 12 & -3 & \\sqrt{13} & -e\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -\\sqrt{11} & -\\frac{9}{4} & \\operatorname{ln}⁡(2)\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186659677 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "377f4f70-2061-5c3e-a072-b822505824c1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659170} {:answer/id #uuid "3e74ad68-8d25-5172-8b8f-a2d6c3027385" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659178} {:answer/id #uuid "6b13e620-a0c7-5dc7-a9b6-8274d67554f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659273} {:answer/id #uuid "8b4e9906-a3a5-5a9f-9474-e6139d232871" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -2\\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659329} {:answer/id #uuid "9012a237-3f4b-5b62-a98a-bffbee1876f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5\\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\sqrt{3} \\\\ -2\\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659337}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3e74ad68-8d25-5172-8b8f-a2d6c3027385" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659178} :answer-field/id #uuid "e452d4b0-1ee6-518b-b7b3-dc7240d5b309" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186659647}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1f646e33-2492-5ac7-bd9e-c7bb0102bc94" :question/math-academy-id "q-41895" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3} & \\sqrt{3} & -2\\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand \n$$\n\\displaystyle B=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $2$nd *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3} & \\sqrt{3} & -2\\sqrt{7}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2\\cdot 0+\\sqrt{2}\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 1+(-4)\\cdot 0 \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3}\\cdot 0+\\sqrt{3}\\cdot 1+(-2\\sqrt{7})\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719018 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ee762fa-b324-513b-b936-fd7b2795a621" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719020}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2ee762fa-b324-513b-b936-fd7b2795a621" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719020} :answer-field/id #uuid "3988d708-529f-5e7e-8114-a941035951f4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719024} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1bd763c-4c02-5e86-9eb3-51cc802de726" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719035}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c1bd763c-4c02-5e86-9eb3-51cc802de726" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719035} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b89d573-faff-5309-aa6c-c6f23b3b72a6" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719025} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7c9e54ca-c72c-5c48-aff7-5d10f5d7e232" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719029}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7c9e54ca-c72c-5c48-aff7-5d10f5d7e232" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719029} :answer-field/id #uuid "ad889906-c6af-5967-b627-3b5f4ff9b709" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719033}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "21b9679a-6126-5d76-a9e0-4b35f189b7f2" :question/problem "Find the product $CD$, if\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\sqrt{3} & \\frac{1}{2} & -6 \\\\ 4 & -5 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 2\\sqrt{2} & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nEnter the entries of the resulting row in order.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$CD=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $C$ is the first row of $I_3$. Multiplying $D$ by this row on the left selects the first row of $D$, so\n$$\nCD=\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\sqrt{3} & \\frac{1}{2} & -6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nEach entry is the dot product of $C$ with the corresponding column of $D$. From left to right, these entries are\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n1\\cdot(-2\\sqrt{3})+0\\cdot4+0\\cdot7 &= -2\\sqrt{3}, \\\\\n1\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}+0\\cdot(-5)+0\\cdot2\\sqrt{2} &= \\frac{1}{2}, \\\\\n1\\cdot(-6)+0\\cdot0+0\\cdot3 &= -6.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719026 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2c494c36-4d5a-5844-acbf-5cc08af13205" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719019} {:answer/id #uuid "306e69ae-39fa-5dbc-b90f-8bc66db08360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719021} {:answer/id #uuid "b2989509-f2d2-5e34-9f51-1e0afeb23848" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 5 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719034} {:answer/id #uuid "c2d911f7-de83-5c53-b365-d3435947e100" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} & -\\sqrt{5} & 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719036} {:answer/id #uuid "df33ca56-a0e5-56b3-b98d-328d74952f87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719037}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "306e69ae-39fa-5dbc-b90f-8bc66db08360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719021} :answer-field/id #uuid "36619b20-5af2-598d-b5c1-7c398acdef50" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719023}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6394abf7-6f04-5053-a343-8b58585752a8" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2} & -3 & \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ 5 & 1 & -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ -4 & 6 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n" :question/worked-solution "The vector $B$ is the third column of $I_3$. Multiplying $A$ by this column on the right selects the third column of $A$:\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nTo check by row-by-column multiplication:\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{2}\\cdot0+(-3)\\cdot0+\\frac{7}{2}\\cdot1 \\\\ 5\\cdot0+1\\cdot0+(-\\sqrt{5})\\cdot1 \\\\ (-4)\\cdot0+6\\cdot0+2\\cdot1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{7}{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719038 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "34b88b36-8549-5142-a9d7-1555ab729c6a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719022} {:answer/id #uuid "6fb764eb-3624-5bc8-a000-e7f9a47dcf42" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719027} {:answer/id #uuid "7ed5ea3c-3cac-589b-aa94-56878ed18719" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719030} {:answer/id #uuid "8f0c5d87-45fd-5601-a771-a19f41d96271" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719031} {:answer/id #uuid "939026d0-c3ad-5987-9096-f03227968a4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719032}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8f0c5d87-45fd-5601-a771-a19f41d96271" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719031} :answer-field/id #uuid "752b8425-fba5-5416-ad03-96b29ddcaa9e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719028}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "df36c768-19ab-5b92-8fc5-34754f2d10d7" :question/problem "Calculate the product $(LM)R$, where\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 7 & 3 & -6 \\\\ -8 & -4 & 9\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\nand\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nSelect the resulting $1\\times1$ matrix." :question/worked-solution "First, $L$ is the third row of $I_3$, so multiplying on the left selects the third row of $M$:\n$$\nLM=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & -4 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nNext, $R$ is the second column of $I_3$. Multiplying on the right selects the second column of that row. The result is a $1\\times1$ matrix:\n$$\n(LM)R=\\begin{bmatrix}-4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\nTo check the final multiplication, the single entry is the dot product\n$$\n(-8)\\cdot0+(-4)\\cdot1+9\\cdot0=-4.\n$$\nBoth selectors matter: the row selector chooses row $3$, and the column selector chooses column $2$. The selected entry is $M_{32}=-4$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719622 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d6163ec-0bb7-5a4b-b379-e604ec8839bb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719616} {:answer/id #uuid "55665bbe-f9d4-5ec2-a2f0-8388f80431fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719625} {:answer/id #uuid "668b57f5-935f-5de4-a4ab-f5fe42d984f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719629} {:answer/id #uuid "6d69c73c-19f3-5e61-bbaa-c421738c78c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719630} {:answer/id #uuid "f89b865b-acb5-5a5a-9aba-702a3021e82a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719646}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1d6163ec-0bb7-5a4b-b379-e604ec8839bb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719616} :answer-field/id #uuid "59353e0d-dacf-541f-a465-2a52c7d1564d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719626}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3fa778f8-9ad6-5505-9711-40ee1362351d" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & 0 & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $B$ is column $2$ of $I_3$. Multiplying on the right selects column $2$ of $A$:\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nCheck the entries by row-by-column multiplication:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 0+(0)\\cdot 1+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 0&=0 \\\\ (0)\\cdot 0+(1)\\cdot 1+(0)\\cdot 0&=1 \\\\ \\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 0+(0)\\cdot 1+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot 0&=0\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719628 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f680b52-0377-56bb-b50d-7fd4d5a5cba3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719619} {:answer/id #uuid "3ea6bcde-d4b6-545c-b364-8f4eec9f4780" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3.5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719621} {:answer/id #uuid "c46e176a-97ac-508a-824f-856459501c9d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719639} {:answer/id #uuid "ed8a5a98-c56a-5913-b418-b75f58bc7078" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719644} {:answer/id #uuid "fdc8e2ba-4d27-5ec8-ad89-5007fb895d1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719647}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c46e176a-97ac-508a-824f-856459501c9d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719639} :answer-field/id #uuid "2dcc2d87-fdc6-5512-8291-70870399fd0a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719618}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "610431da-471a-5a7d-84b4-2a87f220851f" :question/problem "Find the product $AB$, if\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 8 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 8 & 4 \\\\ 3.5 & 8 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nand\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $B$ is column $2$ of $I_3$. Multiplying on the right selects column $2$ of $A$:\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nCheck the entries by row-by-column multiplication:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(7)\\cdot 0+(8)\\cdot 1+(2)\\cdot 0&=8 \\\\ (0)\\cdot 0+(8)\\cdot 1+(4)\\cdot 0&=8 \\\\ (3.5)\\cdot 0+(8)\\cdot 1+(-8)\\cdot 0&=8\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719633 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20f4dd45-da51-53df-9104-be11038027bf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719617} {:answer/id #uuid "301d678c-ac36-5e16-a0de-0efeaf1c231f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719620} {:answer/id #uuid "c7f75b98-4d44-55a7-8e00-7bc516d7bb76" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719640} {:answer/id #uuid "d868200d-cf38-5be4-9bc6-6d9e3b582547" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719641} {:answer/id #uuid "ef6537e3-e1a7-5f65-83d7-16a58eeeaa01" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719645}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d868200d-cf38-5be4-9bc6-6d9e3b582547" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719641} :answer